; Otter Raid -- scenery stamps (multicolour game chars, $60-$FE)
;
;   .  blue  w  light blue  b  brown  g  green
;   -  transparent: LAND/SHORE stamps fill it with the CH_LAND grass,
;      WATER stamps with plain water.  A char cell that is entirely '-'
;      becomes $FF ("keep the underlying cell") in the stamp table.
;
; @stamp NAME class=LAND|WATER|SHORE_L|SHORE_R|SPECIAL [bg=land|water]
; Size = image size / (4x8).  Rows are top first.  Identical chars are
; shared between stamps automatically.  Light comes from the top-left.

